      "doc-ar-2024 page 11 of 18\n\n\n## independent auditor's report\n\nto the members of national infrastructure corp. ltd..\n\n\nwe have audited the accompanying financial statements of the company for the year ended 31 march\n2025. in our opinion and to the best of our information, the aforesaid financial statements give a true\nand fair view of the state of affairs of the company, its profit and its cash flows for the year, in\nconformity with the accounting principles generally accepted in india.\n\n\nour audit was conducted in accordance with the applicable standards on auditing. we believe the\naudit evidence we have obtained is sufficient and appropriate to provide a basis for our opinion.\n\n\nca meera ghosh\n\nstatutory auditors\n\n\ndoc-ar-2024 page 12 of 18\n\n\n## annexure — trial balance as at 31 march 2025": "Code",
